        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Read the free functional-difference resolvent calculation, the normalized kernel Fourier probability measure and convolution identity, Lemma3.3 full majorization construction, and Section3.2 cumulative eigenvalue/trace proof. Ky Fan/Birman-Schwinger facts and the short general majorization lemma quoted with attribution to [6] are prior background; the operator-specific convolution and trace argument are supplied in full. Select only inequality(1.2). Section4 attains equality for a separately defined Dirac point interaction, which is not an L1 function; no equality-attainment assertion for L1 potentials is included, and no separate point-interaction helper is counted."
